  message: "REVISED 2026-05-08: Master report §3 BUG-06 + Round 10 retroactively reframe this item. Original filing (P3 todo_hard, title about argparse silent-accept of misplaced top-level flag) was based on a hypothesis Round 10 falsified. The actual root cause of Rounds 09 and 10's null engagement is the missing hypergumbo-lang-rust-analyzer Python integration package in the published v4.1.0 distribution — Round 10 confirmed via process-tree, distribution-metadata, and PyPI probes. Item retitled and bumped P3→P2 to match the master report's MED–HIGH severity. The argparse silent-accept observation is preserved as a secondary observation in the description for completeness, but is not the causal issue here."  # 3734
